        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.5.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 5:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu biro ebyo hakaba hariho abantu bamwe abaabaire bari aho, baamuteekyerereza eby'Abanyagalilaaya, abu Pilaato yaajwangize eshagama yaabo n'ebitambo byabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabagarukamu ati: Nimugira ngu Abanyagalilaaya abo bakaba bari abasiisi okukira abandi Banyagalilaaya boona, nikyo baitiirwe kubi batyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbagambira nti: Tikwo kiri; mumanye ngu naimwe, ku muraabe muteeteisize, muryahwerekyerera mwena nkabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nari shi, abantu abo ikumi na munaana, abu omunaara gw'omuri Siloamu gwagwereire, gukabaita, nimugira ngu bakaba bari abasiisi okukira abandi boona abaabaire batuura Yerusaalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbagambira nti: Tikwo kiri; mumanye ngu naimwe ku muraabe muteeteisize, muryahwerekyerera mwena nkabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
